{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Today is swimming day. Nora feels butterflies in her tummy.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.46,0.57],[0.64,1.11],[1.18,1.66],[1.95,2.26],[2.33,2.65],[2.73,3.39],[3.44,3.53],[3.59,3.68],[3.74,4.5]]},{"text":"She stands near the pool and hears loud splashes. Her voice gets quiet.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.29,0.72],[0.79,0.99],[1.04,1.11],[1.2,1.54],[1.61,1.73],[1.82,2.15],[2.25,2.55],[2.61,3.54],[3.99,4.17],[4.26,4.59],[4.63,4.88],[4.96,5.99]]},{"text":"Coach smiles and says, We can do this one small step at a time.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.45,0.99],[1.04,1.16],[1.24,1.67],[1.96,2.1],[2.16,2.31],[2.38,2.48],[2.55,2.74],[2.88,3.22],[3.27,3.63],[3.69,3.97],[4.04,4.14],[4.2,4.25],[4.33,5.2]]},{"text":"Step one: dip toes in water. Step two: hold the wall.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.48,0.84],[1.04,1.26],[1.35,1.6],[1.66,1.75],[1.83,2.36],[2.6,2.9],[2.97,3.38],[3.59,3.85],[3.9,3.97],[4.03,4.78]]},{"text":"Nora breathes slowly and tries each step.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.86],[0.88,1.37],[1.43,1.54],[1.61,2],[2.07,2.28],[2.33,3.11]]},{"text":"She asks, Can you stay close? Coach says, Yes, I am right here.","words":[[0,0.23],[0.31,0.87],[1.11,1.31],[1.38,1.45],[1.5,1.75],[1.83,2.38],[2.83,3.15],[3.2,3.65],[3.79,4.21],[4.3,4.35],[4.43,4.55],[4.63,4.9],[4.97,5.67]]},{"text":"Soon Nora kicks while holding the wall.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.38,0.72],[0.8,1.11],[1.16,1.43],[1.49,1.87],[1.93,2],[2.06,2.83]]},{"text":"Then she floats with a noodle and a big grin.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.41],[0.48,0.82],[0.87,1.03],[1.08,1.1],[1.17,1.6],[1.67,1.83],[1.89,1.92],[2,2.21],[2.29,3.02]]},{"text":"After practice, Nora says, I was worried, and then I got brave.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.43,1.03],[1.08,1.45],[1.52,2.09],[2.33,2.39],[2.47,2.63],[2.73,3.29],[3.33,3.52],[3.59,3.75],[3.82,3.87],[3.97,4.19],[4.27,5.11]]},{"text":"She learns courage is not no fear; courage is trying with support.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.29,0.7],[0.84,1.26],[1.31,1.41],[1.49,1.68],[1.75,1.92],[2.06,2.62],[2.95,3.37],[3.41,3.51],[3.59,3.99],[4.05,4.25],[4.32,5.39]]}]}